# Nothing in this package is generated at install time, so there is little to
# ignore. The one entry that matters is the unpacked ECDICT source: it is 63 MB,
# it is not needed at runtime, and `tools/build-dict.mjs` reproduces
# `data/dict.json` from it in about two seconds.

# ECDICT source CSV (re-download, then rebuild — see data/NOTICE.md)
ecdict.csv

